DESCRIPTION:Saturday · 9:00 AM-4:00 PM\n\nTwo hundred tables of sports car
 ds and trading card games fill a hall on the UWF campus\, with more than a
  hundred vendors in from five states to buy\, sell and trade. Anyone fifte
 en and under gets in free\, so a kid can work a table with five dollars an
 d come out with something. The vendor list runs from vintage baseball to P
 okémon: DJ's Vintage Cards and Collectibles\, Big Hit Sportscards\, Card 
 Sharks and Bargain Sports Collectibles on the sports side\, PokéPal Colle
 ctibles and 850 Pokestop on the TCG side\, and PCOLABREAKS running breaks.
  The organizers run this show at the same building each time and put a sha
 re of it behind the Rally Foundation\, which funds childhood cancer resear
 ch.\n\nPrice: from $5\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-c
 ards-on-the-coast-uwf-1212.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-cards-on-the-coast-uwf-1212.html
